%% The merge's sites supply Integer and String, and neither makes every site
%% well-typed: refused, by the site the binding leaving the fewest sites
%% ill-typed does not fit (B's Stream<String> is not within Stream<Integer>),
%% whichever input the merge takes first.
procedure bad(Stream(Integer)?, Stream(String)?, Stream(Integer)).
bad(A, B, C?) :- merge(B?, A?, C).
